ogsr-nvrhi provides NVRHI as static libraries (no CMake config is installed):

    include:  <nvrhi/nvrhi.h>, <nvrhi/d3d11.h>, <nvrhi/d3d12.h>, <nvrhi/validation.h>, <nvrhi/utils.h>
    libs:     nvrhi.lib, nvrhi_d3d11.lib, nvrhi_d3d12.lib (+ d3d11.lib, d3d12.lib, dxguid.lib from the Windows SDK,
              DirectX-Guids.lib from directx-headers for the D3D12 backend)

With MSBuild's vcpkg integration the libraries are linked automatically.
